== Repeat honorees ==
Eight authors have won two Carnegie Medals,<!-- source is inspection of our list sorted by author, nearly reliable --> which was prohibited for many years.{{Citation needed|date=June 2023}} Additionally, several authors have been shortlisted and/or commended multiple times.

